a gebbeth~
Wrapped in its burial shroud, a solitary being wanders the crypts.
~
You first notice two bright blue points of light emerge from the gloom of the
crypt passageway. The stench of death and decay overwhelms you, as you realize
that these are glowing eyes amidst a face of rotting flesh. Its foul form
moves toward you in a slow, twisted fashion, its entrails dangling from its
ravaged midsection, and dragging along the stone floor. Your mind wonders -
Why is Frontline following me?
~
