#10302
dracolich skeletal dragon~
the dracolich~
A skeletal dragon rises before you.
~
The creature bolts up in shock at the sight of you, emitting a terrifying ear-
piercing shriek that sounds like the wailing screams of a thousand dying
souls. At the end of each wing bone are claws with 8 hooked talons covered in
decaying remains. Exoskeletal horns twist their way up from its skull, ending
in points finer than any weapon. A skeletal mandible juts out, exposing
thousands of tiny needle-sized fangs. The dracolich lunges in your direction
with liquid speed, running in an eerily disjointed manner as it focuses its
terrible undead gaze on you!
~
